 "notes": [
  "Posted 6 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (6): Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Start Your Engines!, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Sebulba's Podracer, Boonta Eve Podrace, Expand The Empire; these count toward the 60. No objective; Jabba's Palace is the starting site and Expand The Empire the only Effect in the starting section.",
  "Two-sided cards dested the Dark pages: Boonta Eve Podrace (Dark), Tatooine: Podrace Arena (Dark), Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark), Jabba's Palace: Entrance Cavern (Dark) (posted 'Enterance Cavern'). 'Tatooine Jabba's Palace' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace-set site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace.",
  "Posted 'Darth Maul's Lightsaber' dested Maul's Lightsaber; 'U-3PO' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Twi-Lek Advisor' dested Twi'lek Advisor; 'Omni Box & It's Worse' dested Ommni Box & It's Worse; Weapon Levitation is the Dark Cloud City interrupt. Secret Plans and Come Here You Big Coward are 2001 Effects, counted in the 60.",
  "Michael Pistone (DeckTech MadSkills84) already has a wiki page.",
